      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>I tried that and it didnt work. I even did the thing where i turn it off and on again like my nephew says but still nothing. i just need it to work for my meeting so people can hear me. is there like a deeper setting i need to change or something? i really need a real fix not just the basics.",
